<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-NG KAPITAL GETS RIGHT TO TRADE ON BOURSE SYSTEM.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-NG KAPITAL GETS RIGHT TO TRADE ON BOURSE SYSTEM.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>NG Kapital has the right to use the Tallinn stock exchange trading system to carry out bourse trades, the Tallinn bourse said on Monday.</p>
<p>The dealer for NG Kapital is Marko Pahlapuu, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
